desc: Strip qualifier, reverse, and renumber 100 enum members 1..N
category: expert
par: 44
hint1: A bare :g whose command moves every match to the very top will quietly flip the file end-over-end.
hint2: Don't type the new numbers — let the replacement be evaluated, and ask each line where it lives.
